Portions of the extraction model and resolver design are informed by
typescript-api-extractor, copyright (c) 2025 Michał Dudak, at commit e145350.
The compound-type canonicalization, equivalence, and rendering policy in
`src/canonical/` is ported from that project. The array, tuple, and mapped-type
resolution policy in `src/parse/container.ts` and `src/parse/mapped.ts` follows
its resolvers.

Fixtures under `test/fixtures/` whose record in `scripts/fixture-catalog.ts` is
marked `immutable-upstream` carry that project's inputs and `output.json`
oracles unchanged. Every `output.tsgo.json`, `warnings.tsgo.json`, and
`ts7-oracle.json` file, and every fixture not so marked, was written in this
repository.

